file = "sdk/x/staking/keeper/grpc_query.go"
line = 396
class = "interface-mismatch"
severity = "high"
observed = "Redelegations handles an exact address triple and source-only specially; every other request reaches queryAllRedelegations at line 527, which reads only DelegatorAddr. A delegator plus source or destination therefore returns redelegations for other validators. The protobuf request, gateway query parameters and precompiles/staking/staking.go:1050 all transport those filters."
expected = "QueryRedelegationsRequest src_validator_addr and dst_validator_addr must restrict the returned records consistently with GetAllRedelegations and the supported REST/gRPC requests. Page totals and continuation keys must describe the filtered result."
proposal = "In sdk/x/staking/keeper/grpc_query.go apply all supplied validator filters before pagination, using the appropriate indexes or filtered pagination. Drive gRPC, HTTP gateway and the staking precompile with multiple source/destination distractors and prove every page contains only matches."
